      "amount": "pinch"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Soften coconut cream by microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Add pecans, almond flour, flax seeds, nutritional yeast, vanilla extract, and salt to a blender. Blend until smooth and creamy.",
    "Fold the blended mixture into the softened coconut cream with ripe banana pieces.",
    "Shape the mixture into small balls or cups using your hands, then flatten slightly.",
    "Lightly fry in oil at 160°C (320°F) for about 2-3 minutes on each side until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Serve hot as a snack."
  ],
